# Frontend Rules - Next.js 15 + React 19 + TypeScript

## Next.js 15 App Router
- **App Router exclusively** - no pages router
- **Server Components by default** - mark 'use client' only when needed
- **Client boundaries** - colocate client logic, minimize 'use client' files
- **Route groups** for organization - (auth), (dashboard)
- **Loading states** - loading.tsx for suspense boundaries
- **Error boundaries** - error.tsx for route errors
- **Parallel routes** for complex layouts
- **Intercepting routes** for modals
- **Route handlers** - app/api for backend-for-frontend
- **Metadata API** - export metadata objects

## File Structure
```
src/
  ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router
  │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout
  │   ├── page.tsx             # Home page
  │   ├── loading.tsx          # Global loading
  │   ├── error.tsx            # Global error
  │   ├── not-found.tsx        # 404 page
  │   ├── api/                 # Route handlers
  │   ├── [locale]/            # i18n routing
  │   │   ├── layout.tsx
  │   │   ├── page.tsx
  │   │   └── ...
  │   └── ...
  ├── components/
  │   ├── ui/                  # shadcn/ui components
  │   ├── forms/                 # Form-specific components
  │   ├── layout/                # Layout components
  │   └── features/              # Feature components
  │       └── {feature}/
  ├── hooks/                     # Custom React hooks
  ├── lib/                       # Utilities, configurations
  │   ├── api.ts                 # API client setup
  │   ├── i18n/                  # i18n config
  │   └── utils.ts               # Utility functions
  ├── stores/                    # Zustand stores
  ├── types/                     # Frontend-specific types
  └── styles/                    # Global styles (minimal)
```

## React 19 Patterns
- **Server Components first** - no 'use client' without reason
- **'use client' triggers**:
  - useState, useEffect, useReducer
  - Browser APIs (window, document, localStorage)
  - Event handlers (onClick, onSubmit)
  - Context consumers
- **Composition over props drilling** - use composition patterns
- **Custom hooks** for shared logic - prefix with 'use'
- **React Server Components** - fetch data in Server Components
- **Suspense boundaries** - wrap async components
- **Error boundaries** - handle errors gracefully
- **Cleanup in useEffect** - return cleanup function
- **Dependency arrays** - exhaustive and correct

## Component Patterns
- **Single responsibility** - one component, one purpose
- **Props interface** - always define, no inline types
- **Default props** - use default parameters, not defaultProps
- **Destructured props** - in function parameters
- **Forward refs** when needed - use React.forwardRef
- **Compound components** for complex UIs
- **Render props** pattern for flexibility
- **Polymorphic components** with as prop
- **No class components** - functional only

## Styling (Tailwind + shadcn/ui)
- **Tailwind classes** - use tailwind-merge + clsx (cn utility)
- **shadcn/ui base** - extend, don't recreate
- **Design tokens** - use CSS variables from globals.css
- **Responsive** - mobile-first (sm:, md:, lg:)
- **Dark mode** - use class strategy
- **Component variants** - use class-variance-authority
- **No arbitrary values** - extend tailwind.config.ts
- **Group/peer** modifiers for complex layouts
- **Container queries** for component-based responsive

## State Management
- **Server state** - TanStack Query (React Query)
  - Stale time, cache time configuration
  - Error handling, retries
  - Optimistic updates
  - Infinite queries for pagination
- **Client state** - Zustand
  - Small, focused stores
  - Actions in store, not components
  - Persist only what's needed
  - No Redux-style reducers
- **Form state** - React Hook Form + Zod
  - Validation schemas with zodResolver
  - Controlled components default
  - Error messages from i18n
- **URL state** - useSearchParams for shareable state

## Data Fetching
- **Server Components** - fetch directly, no useEffect
- **TanStack Query** - for client-side data
- **API layer abstraction** - centralized in lib/api.ts
- **Error boundaries** - handle fetch errors
- **Loading states** - skeletons, not spinners
- **SWR pattern** - stale-while-revalidate
- **Prefetching** - Link prefetch, router.prefetch
- **Mutation handling** - optimistic updates, rollback

## i18n (next-intl)
- **Server-side translations** - in Server Components
- **Client-side translations** - useTranslations hook
- **Message keys** - hierarchical, descriptive
- **Interpolation** - {variable} syntax
- **Pluralization** - ICU message syntax
- **Date/number formatting** - use formatters
- **Locale detection** - middleware-based
- **Route localization** - [locale] segment

## Form Handling
- **React Hook Form** - performance, validation
- **Zod schemas** - shared with backend when possible
- **Controlled inputs** - register pattern
- **Error display** - inline, accessible
- **Submit handling** - async, loading state
- **Reset capability** - form.reset()
- **File uploads** - separate handling

## Accessibility
- **Semantic HTML** - proper heading hierarchy
- **ARIA labels** - when semantic not enough
- **Keyboard navigation** - tabIndex, focus management
- **Color contrast** - WCAG 2.1 AA minimum
- **Screen reader testing** - VoiceOver/NVDA
- **Focus indicators** - visible focus rings
- **Reduced motion** - respect prefers-reduced-motion
- **Alt text** - descriptive for images

## Performance Frontend
- **Code splitting** - dynamic imports for heavy components
- **Image optimization** - Next.js Image component
- **Font optimization** - next/font
- **Script loading** - strategy props
- **Preload/prefetch** - critical resources
- **Intersection Observer** - lazy load below fold
- **Virtualization** - react-window for long lists
- **Memoization** - React.memo, useMemo, useCallback
  - Only when measured performance issue
  - Dependencies must be stable

## Testing Frontend
- **Jest + React Testing Library**
- **Test behaviors** not implementation
- **User-centric queries** - getByRole, getByLabelText
- **Mock Service Worker** for API mocking
- **Component stories** - Storybook for complex UIs
- **E2E critical flows** - Playwright
- **Visual regression** - Chromatic/Storybook

## TypeScript Frontend
- **Strict mode** - no implicit any
- **Component props** - explicit interfaces
- **Generic components** - when type-safe flexibility needed
- **Type guards** - for runtime type checking
- **Module augmentation** - for third-party types
- **No type assertions** (as) - use type guards

## Bundle Optimization
- **Tree shaking** - ES modules, sideEffect: false
- **Dependency analysis** - @next/bundle-analyzer
- **Dynamic imports** - React.lazy for routes
- **Vendor chunk** - split large deps
- **CSS optimization** - PurgeCSS built-in

## SEO
- **Metadata API** - generateMetadata function
- **Open Graph** - og:title, og:description, og:image
- **Twitter cards** - twitter:card, twitter:image
- **Structured data** - JSON-LD scripts
- **Sitemap** - dynamic sitemap generation
- **Robots.txt** - allow/disallow rules
